        <span begin="02:48.340" end="02:48.400">d </span>
        <span begin="02:48.400" end="02:48.910">still </span>
        <span begin="02:48.910" end="03:31.420">die </span>
        <span begin="03:31.420" end="03:31.510">for </span>
        <span begin="03:31.510" end="03:31.570">you</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </body>
</tt>
